### Get User's Logbook
GET {{host}}/logbook
Authorization: {{student_token}}


### Get User's Logbook Contents
GET {{host}}/logbook/entries
Authorization: {{student_token}}


### Insert logbook entry
POST {{host}}/logbook/entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{student_token}}

{
  "description": "Updated random description"
}

### Start logbook count
POST {{host}}/logbook/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{student_token}}

### Employer comment on logbook for week
POST {{host}}/logbook/d751eeea-5611-407a-982e-33a5353e685e/comment/employer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

{
  "weekNumber": 1,
  "comment": "Very good performance for the week"
}